  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With web panels being disabled and no current idea if they will be returning in the future here is a suggestion to help fill the void. A component that applies a texture from a url. There's already a image downloader component but players cant use it. \n\nHow i see it working is two ways. one would be like the set material action where you can specify a material and url. A second method would be how the VRC_Video screen is structured so you can add a url at the top then below you can specify the material index and texture property. \n\nThis would allow people to load information without updating the world. some examples would be posters, character sheets for games, talk show visuals, and many more.",
